      443.47,
      539.96,
      611.29
    ],
    "text": "Name and address of Claimants: Mr. Mathara Hakmana Mada Walawwe Chandra Lalith Weerasingha and Mrs. Lokeswara Uththama Chandrasekara Shalani Weerasingha, No. 7, Namal Mawatha, Padiwaththa\u201d Kundasale. All persons interested in the aforesaid land servitude on which is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Udadumbara on the 20th day of May 2024 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicates) on or before the 13th day of May 2024 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land , the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
